# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# id: vttest.cup-clamps-at-screen-edges
# geometry: 80 24
# expect-cursor: 23 79
# expect-line: 0 =
#
# Absolute cursor addressing past the bottom-right edge clamps to the last
# row and column instead of wrapping, scrolling, or panicking. Companion to
# the conformance replay fixture replay/cursor-addressing.vtseq, minimized
# to the single clamp assertion.
#
# Escapes: \e ESC, \r CR, \n LF, \t HT, \\ backslash, \xNN one byte.
# Every other character is emitted literally. Lines add no implicit newline.

# Ask for row 999, column 999 on an 80x24 grid; nothing is printed.
\e[999;999H
